*: {{rhymes|is|aihta|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|is|non|hætta}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*hanhtijǭ}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|@@}}

# [[danger]]
# [[hazard]], [[jeopardy]]
# [[peril]]

