===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|is|non|hætta}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*hanhtijaną}}. In the sense “stop” an unstressed prefix has likely been dropped, perhaps {{m|gem-pro|*ab-}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-weak|hætti|hætt}}

# to [[risk]] {{gloss|put at risk}}, [[jeopardize]] {{+obj|is|dat}}
# to [[quit]], [[stop]], [[cease]], [[cut out]], [[discontinue]] {{+obj|is|&intransitive/dat}}
#: {{syn|is|taka fyrir}}
#: {{uxi|is|[[ég|Ég]] '''hætti''' [[að]] [[reykja]].|I '''stopped''' [[smoking]].}}
#: {{uxi|is|'''Hættu'''!|'''Stop'''!}}

